   "author_name": "Tom Pelissero",
   "author_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tompelissero.bsky.social",
   "text": "Panthers Pro Bowl CB Jaycee Horn is out indefinitely after suffering a quad injury in Sunday’s loss to the Browns, sources tell The Ringer and Netflix Sports.\n\nHorn is seeking a second opinion. But he’s likely to land on injured reserve and miss significant time.",
