   "author_name": "Tom Pelissero",
   "author_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tompelissero.bsky.social",
   "text": "By trading J.J. McCarthy now, the Vikings save over $4.6M in cash and cap space and get an unconditional fifth-round pick in the next draft that, depending how the Giants finish, could end up being a top-150 selection.\n\nMeanwhile, New York adds another former first-round pick QB.",
