   "author_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tompelissero.bsky.social",
   "text": "Trade! The Vikings are sending QB J.J. McCarthy to the Giants for a 2027 fifth-round pick, sources tell The Ringer and Netflix Sports.\n\nWith Jaxson Dart out for the regular season, New York adds another young QB, while Minnesota gains flexibility and McCarthy gets a fresh start.",
   "posted_at": "2026-09-28T16:10:27.509Z",
